<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86920" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προγρᾰφή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>public notice, advertisement,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.Mag.</u>
				4.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				25.3.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				976.37
			</span></i>(Samos, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				515.38
			</span></i> (Mylasa, <span class="entity">iii A.D.</span>); <i>edict,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				47.13
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ προγραφῆς</span> by
				<i>edict,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				56.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>notice of sale,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				97.2
			</span></i>(pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.205c
			</span></i>; <i>public sale of confiscated property,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				5.4.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ θανάτῳ προγραφαί</span>”
				<i>proscriptions,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					1.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφαγαὶ καὶ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Brut.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			; <i>warrant</i> for arrest, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				372.8
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>, pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>table drawn up in advance,</i> of an astronomical cycle, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				12.36
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>heading, preliminary form</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				780.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.Prot.
				p.16D.
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>title</i> of a prescription, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.777
			</span></i>:—
				Dim.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προγον-γράφιον</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, τό, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				5273.10
			</span></i><span class="entity">(v A.D.)</span>.</div>
